    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d187-a2">

                <pb facs="0369" n="265" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg265"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    120.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Roldán to Mr.
                            Abbott.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-10-14"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 14,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The judge of the circuit of Tequendama, in
                    the department of Cundinamarca, in whose court are now taking place the
                    proceedings relative to the settlement of the estate of Alexander Henry, a
                    citizen of the United States, has resolved to cite his widow and children, who
                    live in the city of Wheeling, State of West Virginia; and, in the letters
                    rogatory which I have the honor to send herewith, the said judge requests the
                    chief justice of the Ohio county court to have the kindness to cause to be duly
                    served the said summons.</p>
                <p>Owing to the circumstance of there being ho Colombian agent residing in Ohio
                    through whose medium the letters rogatory could be sent, I am constrained to beg
                    of Your Excellency to be good enough to forward it to its destination; in doing
                    which not only would the dangers of miscarrying the document be avoided, but
                    time would be saved in the settlement of the estate.</p>
                <p>Anticipating to Your Excellency the expression of my gratitude for your good
                    advice in the matter, I am pleased to renew, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Antonio Roldán.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
